## SpecFold v2 Integration

### Incremental Slicing
- Implement **ONE slice at a time** (UI component + service + route + tests)
- Do **not** implement entire feature at once

### Feature Flags
- Hide incomplete UI behind feature flags
  ```typescript
  export const FEATURE_FLAGS = {
    viewOrders: false, // Not ready yet
    createOrders: true
  };
  
  @Component({
    template: `
      <button *ngIf="featureFlags.viewOrders">View Orders</button>
    `
  })
  export class OrdersComponent {
    featureFlags = FEATURE_FLAGS;
  }
  ```

### Backward Compatibility
- **Additive changes:** New routes, new components, new services
- **Avoid breaking changes:** Removing routes, renaming components, changing public APIs
- Use **router guards** to control access to incomplete features

### Traceability
- Reference **`SF-…`** IDs in:
  - Component comments: `// SF-001: Display order form with items`
  - Test descriptions: `it('should validate order items (SF-001)', ...)`
  - Commit messages: `[Slice 1] Add order form component (SF-001, SF-002)`

